    * `L. H. Laidlaw &lt;https://doi.org/10.1145/15886.15904&gt;`_
    
    for an introduction into the topic of modeling shapes with constructive
    solid geometry (CSG).
  </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXsolid_geometry</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXsolid_geometry.html</rdfs:seeAlso>
  <extends rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXobject</extends>
</owl:Class>

