        Application definition for a generic scan using sensors.
        
        In this application definition, times should be specified always together
        with an UTC offset.
    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXsensor_scan</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXsensor_scan.html</rdfs:seeAlso>
