                     The temperature and voltage must be present as independently scanned controllers and
                     the current sensor must also be present with its readings.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXiv_temp.html#nxiv-temp-entry-instrument-environment-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

