  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            The scan region is the area of phase space or sub-phase space where the scan is
            performed. The region could be N-dimensional and is defined by the minimum and
            maximum values of the scan axes.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXscan_control.html#nxscan-control-scan-region-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
