                    Usually, the entire instrument is supplied by a single manufacturer.
                    To describe the hardware from any sub-components, use the hardware group of that
                    sub-component (child group of the NXinstrument group) group.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXspm.html#nxspm-entry-instrument-hardware-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

