  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                Configuration when snapshots of the system should be taken.
                
                Keep in mind that essentially geometry snapshot data store the
                polylines and polyhedra of all grains which can take substantial disk
                space.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_gragles_config.html#nxmicrostructure-gragles-config-entry-sampling-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
