                    interface at which to place ROIs to profile. This can be the mesh of an
                    interface as returned e.g. by a previous interface_meshing task or the
                    mesh of an iso-surface from a previous delocalization task.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXapm_paraprobe_nanochem_config.html#nxapm-paraprobe-nanochem-config-entry-oned-profile-feature-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

