  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXpositioner/actuator/feedback/pv_sensor</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                    If present, the value and the value_log of this pv_sensor is the same as
                    the value and raw_value of the position itself.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXpositioner.html#nxpositioner-actuator-feedback-pv-sensor-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
