            and maximum wavelength (lower and upper limit) of the range.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXpolarizer_opt.html#nxpolarizer-opt-wavelength-range-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

