  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXdispersive_material.html#nxdispersive-material-entry-definition-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
