  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            Distance which is present between the specimen surface and the detector plane.
            
            This concept is related to term `Camera Length`_ of the EMglossary standard.
            
            .. _Camera Length: https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/emg/EMG_00000008
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXoptical_system_em.html#nxoptical-system-em-camera-length-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

