                            before this measurement. UTC offset should be specified.
                        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXsensor_scan.html#nxsensor-scan-entry-instrument-environment-sensor-calibration-time-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
