            Here the order of the harmonic is stored.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXlockin.html#nxlockin-harmonic-order-n-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
