  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXpositioner_spm.html#nxpositioner-spm-z-offset-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
