            amplification of the amplifier. (array for active channels)
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXamplifier.html#nxamplifier-openloop-amplification-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
