  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            Condensed, 27 character InChI key.
            Hashed version of the full InChI (using the SHA-256 algorithm).
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXsubstance.html#nxsubstance-identifier-inchi-key-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
