                    time stamps, this is an array of length m of voltages.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmanipulator.html#nxmanipulator-sample-bias-voltmeter-value-log-value-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
