            Here we should provide which keywords are available
            and a BNF of valid grammar.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXdispersion_function.html#nxdispersion-function-formula-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
