  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                Integrated ODF intensity within a theta angular region of the orientation space (SO3)
                about each location (obeying symmetries) as specified for each location.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_odf.html#nxmicrostructure-odf-kth-extrema-volume-fraction-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
