			forming the container.
		</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXcontainer.html#nxcontainer-packing-fraction-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
