  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
			The name of an optional mask field in the parent group with rank :math:`\boldsymbol{R}` and
			dimensions :math:`\boldsymbol{d}`. For example, this could be ``pixel_mask`` of an
			:ref:`NXdetector`.
		</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXregion.html#nxregion-parent-mask-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
