                            phase of the cantilever oscillation depending on the experiment condition.
                        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXafm.html#nxafm-entry-instrument-cantilever-spm-cantilever-oscillator-oscillator-excitation-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

