                        Name of the DREAM.3D HDF5 file that was instantiated from the
                        a previously performed DAMASK simulation.
                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_score_config.html#nxmicrostructure-score-config-entry-deformation-damask-file-name-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.org/nexusformat/definitions/Field/NXmicrostructure_score_config/ENTRY/deformation/damask/algorithm">
