  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                    Integration radius that constraints the theta angular region of the orientation space (SO3)
                    about each central location (obeying symmetries) as specified by bunge_euler indexed in
                    the same sequence as the bunge_euler and name fields.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_score_config.html#nxmicrostructure-score-config-entry-component-analysis-theta-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
