  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            Base unit vector along the first axis which spans the coordinate system.
            This axis is frequently referred to as the x-axis in real space and
            the i-axis in reciprocal space.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXcoordinate_system.html#nxcoordinate-system-x-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
