            transformation in the transformation chain in the NXtransformations group.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXcoordinate_system.html#nxcoordinate-system-depends-on-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
