  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
			The reference point of the source plane is its center in the x and y axis. The source is considered infinitely thin in the
			z axis.

			.. image:: source/source.png
			  :width: 40%

		</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXsource.html#nxsource-depends-on-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

