      Accepted photon beam divergence in X+ (horizontal outboard) direction.
      Note that divergence_x_plus+divergence_x_minus is the total horizontal beam divergence.
    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXbending_magnet.html#nxbending-magnet-divergence-x-plus-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
