  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The polar_angle (two theta) where the detector is placed.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXxrot.html#nxxrot-entry-instrument-detector-polar-angle-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
