  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            The unit cell, a, b, c, alpha, beta, gamma. 
            Again, not strictly necessary, but normally written.
          </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXxbase.html#nxxbase-entry-sample-unit-cell-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
