            The first_point_for_fit is True ("1") or False ("0"). This value is required.
          </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXxpcs.html#nxxpcs-entry-twotime-g2-from-two-time-corr-func-first-point-for-fit-attribute</rdfs:seeAlso>
